BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 735 Td (companies often get co-mingled in the same default *"All Customer Groups"* or general) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 723.5 Td (Accounts Receivable \(Debtors\) accounts. This creates serious financial problems:) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 712.0 Td (1. **Financial Statement Distortion:** External revenue looks falsely inflated on) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 700.5 Td (management dashboards because internal stock transfers look like external commercial) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 689.0 Td (sales.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 677.5 Td (2. **AR Aging Misrepresentation:** Overdue intercompany balances sit in the standard) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 666.0 Td (Accounts Receivable aging report alongside external clients, distorting DSO \(Days) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 654.5 Td (Sales Outstanding\) metrics.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 643.0 Td (3. **Complex Year-End Consolidation:** External auditors must spend days manually) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 631.5 Td (sorting through thousands of invoices to extract internal transactions for) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 620.0 Td (elimination.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 608.5 Td (4. **Credit Limits & Tax Policies:** External customers have strict credit limits and) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 597.0 Td (standard sales tax \(VAT/GST\) rules. Sister companies require unlimited credit lines,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 585.5 Td (zero-rated internal transfer pricing, and specific Intercompany Clearing GL accounts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 568.0 Td (By creating a designated **Inter Company Customer Group** and tagging it via the app's) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 556.5 Td (custom field `ic_customer_group`, ERPNext automatically segregates internal debtors,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 545.0 Td (enables automated period-end elimination, and prevents internal orders from being) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 40 533.5 Td (blocked by standard retail credit policies.) Tj ET
